invariant: INV-16
file: poly1305.c
catches: test/lint-wide-multiply.sh
reason: a 64-bit remainder of the accumulator by a key limb is no
  instruction on any of these cores; it is a call into the compiler's
  runtime (__aeabi_uldivmod on the M3, __umoddi3 on mips32r2 and
  rv32imac), whose loop branches on both secret operands, and the gate
  counts those calls beside the opcodes

--- old
        uint64_t c = d0 >> 26;
        h0 = (uint32_t)d0 & 0x3ffffff;
--- new
        uint64_t c = d0 >> 26;
        h0 = (uint32_t)(d0 % r0);
